{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into the skies in <strong>Tinker's Ascent</strong>, a cozy 3D platformer and crafting adventure. Explore floating islands, gather resources, craft tools, and help restore a vibrant world threatened by falling islands high above the clouds.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Platforming</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dive, and dash across the islands at your own pace. Climb structures, wander through varied landscapes, cross moving platforms, and stumble upon unexpected surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gathering, Crafting &amp; Building</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wood, stone, ore, and other materials with your axe, pickaxe, and other tools. Craft equipment, build structures, and create supplies to rebuild the town and surrounding islands, leaving your mark on the world as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Quests &amp; Discovery</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the stories of the islands and the people who live there. From important quests to save the town, to helping a chicken farmer round up her escaped chickens, there\u2019s always something new to see, do, and explore in <strong>Tinker's Ascent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880790?t=1760476598","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880790?t=1760476598","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/5657d40ce913cad05932e2165512bd791d6e230c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760476598","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/5657d40ce913cad05932e2165512bd791d6e230c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760476598","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap into the skies in <strong>Tinker's Ascent</strong>, a cozy 3D platformer and crafting adventure. Explore floating islands, gather resources, craft tools, and help restore a vibrant world threatened by falling islands high above the clouds.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Platforming</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, dive, and dash across the islands at your own pace. Climb structures, wander through varied landscapes, cross moving platforms, and stumble upon unexpected surprises along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/91f5c1b7a32b2c99deb9637cc0cae613.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gathering, Crafting &amp; Building</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wood, stone, ore, and other materials with your axe, pickaxe, and other tools. Craft equipment, build structures, and create supplies to rebuild the town and surrounding islands, leaving your mark on the world as you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/8c687c46fd9cb9d48c1f41adfb7343c6.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Quests &amp; Discovery</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the stories of the islands and the people who live there. From important quests to save the town, to helping a chicken farmer round up her escaped chickens, there\u2019s always something new to see, do, and explore in <strong>Tinker's Ascent</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.poster.avif?t=1760476598\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.webm?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/extras/bc381c722454f82c7e039bc358ac2dd8.mp4?t=1760476598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Maple Jelly Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880790/f7bf35bd736201229d9b6f444c133357690fb9c8/header.jpg?t=1760476598","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3880790/1574728647/6e9e21a6640f3618c514f788deb294dd2242db62/1760120555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760122011","dash_h264":"https